flowchart TD
 S1["1. Define the cost boundary and perspective\nIdentify decision-maker, time horizon, budget holder, functional unit, and relevant lifecycle phases."]
 S2["2. Build the lifecycle cost inventory\nMeasure acquisition, data, integration, infrastructure, validation, training, review, governance, monitoring, incidents, updates, and exit."]
 S1 --> S2
 S3["3. Specify the pricing architecture\nSeparate base, variable, volume, support, integration, escalation, and residual-value terms."]
