 S4["4. Model volume and downside scenarios\nTest uptake, use intensity, implementation delay, review burden, price escalation, and uncertainty."]
 S3 --> S4
 S5["5. Map benefit mechanisms\nLink claimed savings or outcomes to measurable changes, owners, timing, and conversion conditions."]
 S4 --> S5
 S6["6. Calculate ROI and net value cautiously\nDistinguish gross benefit, net benefit, cashable savings, released capacity, and non-monetized value."]
 S5 --> S6
 S7["7. Set benefit-realization and renewal conditions\nAssign owners, thresholds, review dates, remedies, and continuation criteria."]
 S6 --> S7
